{
  "title": { "zh": "竖纹", "en": "Vertical streaks" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "相机传感器三列一组轮流读数，组里三列的灵敏度各不相同：拍下的单据满是竖纹。",
        "en": "The camera’s sensor reads its columns in groups of three, and the three differ in sensitivity: the document photos are full of vertical streaks."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "横着平均正好一个周期，三列的偏差加起来抵消；不往上下平均，字就不糊。",
    "en": "Averaging across exactly one period makes the three columns’ errors cancel; not averaging up and down keeps the text sharp."
  },
  "tray": "main",
  "tasks": [
